"m-808a16bf-9277-4eea-8dff-87eda34c6a70" ulx="26" uly="1405" lrx="465" lry="1444" /><zone xml:id="m-f5dabfba-0ae3-4c4e-a5aa-9e6fbb31de83" ulx="479" uly="1408" lrx="919" lry="1443" /><zone xml:id="m-0a47581a-a976-4358-9c34-c4c7ac9ba6d6" ulx="26" uly="1434" lrx="466" lry="1470" /><zone xml:id="m-a80f3df6-9877-4bf8-9cb8-9dfc3de5220d" ulx="480" uly="1435" lrx="919" lry="1468" /><zone xml:id="m-d8cab659-1e85-4cc5-8dd9-50e25c80c2a8" ulx="26" uly="1461" lrx="466" lry="1497" /><zone xml:id="m-2add5a08-32ac-4cc1-9117-c4c92cf7ce33" ulx="478" uly="1461" lrx="919" lry="1496" /><zone xml:id="m-d743274f-9a5b-4c6e-9772-0ebdc87b455a" ulx="480" uly="1493" lrx="916" lry="1524" /><zone xml:id="m-6e2f104b-d8f2-4e66-9852-377698266705" ulx="27" uly="1494" lrx="464" lry="1523" /><zone xml:id="m-a91e4bbd-f8e7-468b-b457-d013929e3d74" ulx="24" uly="1515" lrx="466" lry="1552" /><zone xml:id="m-4f977e4d-da3a-4b31-8c00-72058f440c2c" ulx="475" uly="1522" lrx="897" lry="1556" /><zone xml:id="m-8efcc5da-842c-4aa2-ad50-f3bcac2e322d" ulx="51" uly="1549" lrx="468" lry="1596" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-efbe5259-d074-4216-9290-095dfb36294d" n="1851" facs="#m-1d3abc5d-5f0a-44ef-9db1-fa1db2e4cd6d" /><div xml:id="m-b3d0bd99-8aa4-4588-8149-32f135deeeb6"><lg xml:id="m-72ac7f77-18b1-4377-83ff-8b2d50e9d82f"><l xml:id="m-9ee6830a-b730-4172-a644-233eea33ceae" facs="#m-ab5396f0-c19e-404b-9f6e-9cc1947849c5" label="ambiguous">August 29.</l><l xml:id="m-ccdef3e5-3779-4af5-8544-be0543d2b3c6" facs="#m-85a4a993-7925-4413-b46c-c65837514971" label="ambiguous">1c19</l><l xml:id="m-b9f7532e-5dfd-44ee-9903-c2b1b4ce68c3" facs="#m-32a4515e-7477-42ba-9ec2-b2804aa765ef" label="lyrics-like">tú-o Altíssime. Gló-ri-a Pátri. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-9fa02c75-56b2-4719-b782-3aeb00f4f37f" facs="#m-4aa0e555-48b0-450b-82c8-52ce93d31e1e" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-807a3b69-43a1-474c-b857-5a192944067f" facs="#m-3d301c9a-fdfe-43c0-b997-f77b8a2b8936" label="lyrics-like">NAncti Joánnis Baptistae Prae-l tas, * salutáris auxilii nobis praestet</l><l xml:id="m-849890bc-b817-4087-9d28-d041964847ba" facs="#m-f78176c0-d6c7-495d-984a-6db7801db267" label="lyrics-like">O cursóris et Mártyris tui, quaé- efféctum : Qui vivis et regnas</l><l xml:id="m-b546a403-f793-4336-b598-15c97ff46e7b" facs="#m-5dd6b372-8d56-431d-ba5b-a917ab743eed" label="lyrics-like">sumus Dómine, veneránda festivi¬</l><l xml:id="m-e7b6e93d-11dd-460b-9ec7-137c7270d115" facs="#m-06e245dd-3047-415e-b15a-868ef1c1507f" label="text-like">Commemoration of St. Sabina, Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-476e38eb-07be-4950-8e9e-0f07885b382d" facs="#m-d63dcad7-6460-44e3-bd13-f513734eb73f" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-3ddf681d-3a87-4e43-9237-6647c94d3261" facs="#m-c3e8a2df-06ca-4c87-8f8d-1893261c1209" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui inter cétera poténtiae beátae Sabínae Mártyris tuae nata¬</l><l xml:id="m-986d9bf7-665e-4f54-b3e9-ddff1c415477" facs="#m-c3672d2f-c8f8-42f4-b7ce-dbb9a719882c" label="lyrics-like">I tuae mirácula étiam in sexu litia cólimus, per ejus ad te exémpla</l><l xml:id="m-b1a0676c-c411-4f1e-aea5-cac120584013" facs="#m-29c75dd3-0895-4465-a8e0-ae55ca0e40df" label="lyrics-like">frãgili victóriam martyrii contu¬</l><l xml:id="m-9b3a5956-5b6f-4e78-b2cb-33d11661a8ed" facs="#m-d132c6a9-b16a-46cc-b5ee-78d8b2d891c7" label="lyrics-like">gradiámur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-c8523097-bd0b-4363-855c-a3710b1a32ea" facs="#m-f0f0d98a-41a7-41e7-82df-7aedd4b532fd" label="lyrics-like">listi : * concéde propitius; ut qui</l><l xml:id="m-48a0b9d5-acaf-4ab5-9ea5-574a1adf8d0b" facs="#m-5f65b081-6a91-4c44-8f76-cc8d96e4540d" label="ambiguous">Lectio Jeremiae Prophetae. Jerem. I. d.</l><l xml:id="m-b2a2fc24-fe5b-422d-934d-15a53ad88436" facs="#m-90d8fa9f-7623-4cd7-9413-cd68d3a2c69e" label="lyrics-like">N diébus illis: Factum est ver- colúmnam férream, et in murum</l><l xml:id="m-50aaa4f3-58ae-406a-a224-193735e40bdc" facs="#m-8e26bc6f-589d-41fe-bb5b-fe86731ead75" label="lyrics-like">A bum Dómini ad me, dicens:</l><l xml:id="m-abf29260-cc3e-4eab-956e-220249287b45" facs="#m-4ae8115f-fd55-4573-833b-8abb1ed71e63" label="lyrics-like">aéreum, super omnem terram, ré¬</l><l xml:id="m-a516485e-0c4c-43cd-a613-de63e0096421" facs="#m-8f369ae9-9705-443d-9686-8443c264fecd" label="lyrics-like">Accínge lumbos tuos, et surge, et</l><l xml:id="m-d346f41b-6746-4ee8-a670-7de2dcdc1ad7" facs="#m-306ce862-1110-4d26-9513-225e17d50760" label="lyrics-like">gibus Juda, princípibus ejus, et</l><l xml:id="m-754ad3aa-4c16-46f3-a8d6-fdb951b10646" facs="#m-95a6f8cc-2c8c-49d9-9a09-536817cf7168" label="lyrics-like">sacerdótibus, et pópulo terrae. Et</l><l xml:id="m-b64627e9-4925-43e2-b9cb-77377fc4646e" facs="#m-5fc6460c-0ffa-4858-b918-4a3350f0d43b" label="lyrics-like">lóquere ad Juda ómnia quae ego</l><l xml:id="m-6f40b06e-11cd-4b0b-9013-686708ec3860" facs="#m-cb5c88d5-3265-4d8c-ace6-60f39c0976dd" label="lyrics-like">praecípio tibi. Ne formides a fácie</l><l xml:id="m-c92eb14a-9c66-473c-8f06-fb3732156200" facs="#m-822e55fd-b19e-4ab0-a21d-fd2c98189989" label="lyrics-like">bellábunt advérsum te, et non prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-0a5c92c9-22c9-4eab-b78c-af2c668f4799" facs="#m-aafff9b7-248d-4480-98e0-3aa3b2b719d6" label="lyrics-like">valébunt; quia ego tecum sum, ait</l><l xml:id="m-de829415-2a86-42e9-889b-b2553aa0d7df" facs="#m-3e412069-8808-44c4-afe2-e646be3f0285" label="lyrics-like">eórum : nec enim timére te fáciam</l><l xml:id="m-ca0c9f71-37b9-4b71-a575-64c3e3b890f2" facs="#m-e606e852-481e-418d-afaa-e7c716e0ee44" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus, ut liberem te.</l><l xml:id="m-2d268766-4a03-456a-9706-81a5f83c6e9e" facs="#m-6abbd199-4677-472a-ac68-7638c22cb96f" label="lyrics-like">vultum eórum. Ego quippe dedi te</l><l xml:id="m-4bfab709-95c9-454e-a71c-b142c3c0a0cd" facs="#m-94c2fed8-80bf-4663-9744-23f1a58517e8" label="lyrics-like">hódie in civitátem munitam, et in</l><l xml:id="m-59d47fff-1c5b-456f-b916-b28c9509b071" facs="#m-7c3fd071-f11f-450c-827c-11faf8e27d35" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Jústus ut pálma. p. 1201. Allelúia, allelúia. V. Jústus germi¬</l><l xml:id="m-6f83e69b-75e7-4c53-bee7-304638288fd0" facs="#m-b5342464-9b82-4dbc-8db8-dc54c5762861" label="lyrics-like">nábit. p. 1152.</l><l xml:id="m-cc4cf533-d97d-4750-b1e4-9143be778e1b" facs="#m-f4c325f6-17cd-422f-b4e4-82f45e78c272" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Marcum. Marc. 6. c.</l><l xml:id="m-93557605-2f81-44c8-8898-379c9fc51f66" facs="#m-4d40a655-abf3-412f-9776-3805bf6e14e3" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Misit Heródes,(me quod vis, et dabo tibi. Et iurá¬</l><l xml:id="m-515688cc-5096-4a0a-a58f-daf260367650" facs="#m-a99e96cc-0a05-4757-a39c-d96779343121" label="lyrics-like">L ac ténuit Joánnem, et vinxit eum</l><l xml:id="m-37ae2f2a-e09a-430f-bd0b-91a95733676a" facs="#m-6c5efced-d40a-4c5f-84c1-7deff28c83cb" label="ambiguous">vit ili: Quia quidquid petieris,</l><l xml:id="m-216ceb7c-2ec2-4e6d-a79c-70baa9aab508" facs="#m-ea7c97bc-d66f-4785-b3d9-6584e630f453" label="ambiguous">dabo tibi, licet dimidium regni mei¬</l><l xml:id="m-adf503eb-69df-4f4b-a7de-8cb937e07285" facs="#m-bd7309f3-d605-473b-badf-b4108c8d47bf" label="lyrics-like">in cárcere propter Herodiadem</l><l xml:id="m-0d003934-8604-456d-88f0-9c1444e0864a" facs="#m-c1f15342-0f19-4b7a-91ff-1c825678ebac" label="lyrics-like">uxórem Philippi fratris sui, quia</l><l xml:id="m-de428ccf-f4c4-4205-8d50-c336a2d148fd" facs="#m-5c39a7c3-3a7d-435b-a817-99921afcb30e" label="lyrics-like">Quae cum exísset, dixit matri suae:</l><l xml:id="m-5bbbf9be-066e-40c4-a137-1c633a488403" facs="#m-8cd1f17e-775f-4411-91de-81525114d82c" label="text-like">Quid petam? At illa dixit: Caput</l><l xml:id="m-b1e95018-baa5-49c7-8813-cbdc64ddab6b" facs="#m-63333ab4-4e1a-4e49-91ad-feff81046348" label="lyrics-like">dúxerat eam. Dicébat enim Joán¬</l><l xml:id="m-13167107-c2de-43dc-87c7-f8b25fed5a40" facs="#m-525fe128-284a-492f-8390-1246ffc6843b" label="lyrics-like">Joánnis Baptistae. Cumque introis¬</l><l xml:id="m-49966bfb-2673-4ca8-8833-feeb2b06805d" facs="#m-3d1fa5ad-d481-4608-aaaa-1fd86fcc4eac" label="lyrics-like">nes Heródi : Non licet tibi habére</l><l xml:id="m-9b162f96-687f-4427-a183-b3462bfc0d31" facs="#m-b60a0420-ad49-4b24-aca4-a018dc5b28bb" label="lyrics-like">uxórem fratris tui. Heródias autem</l><l xml:id="m-c52ea7eb-acf8-41e8-a1ac-9af836597bec" facs="#m-dc79efd5-c034-4283-a01d-21aeebdae552" label="lyrics-like">set statim cum festinatióne ad re¬</l><l xml:id="m-bdcf2c60-e65b-491c-91db-12ad2776e309" facs="#m-d2dacad4-0a69-4204-a2c2-38a467a4c47b" label="lyrics-like">insidiabátur illi, et volébat occidere</l><l xml:id="m-47ca9bba-5616-41f5-ac4c-a59184ee09a0" facs="#m-cefcfa40-08eb-4cbb-9fb8-788773bc4d97" label="lyrics-like">gem, petivit, dicens: Volo ut pró¬</l><l xml:id="m-77bb41dd-2d82-4ae5-b214-94d92aed8fed" facs="#m-d6642af7-94c8-42f7-b4ff-da341a8a2112" label="lyrics-like">eum, nec póterat. Heródes enim</l><l xml:id="m-730043d7-7a71-4eaf-ade9-3ef3e78eef8d" facs="#m-45568dd3-45f4-4037-8e84-de48da058eac" label="lyrics-like">tinus des mihi in disco caput Joán¬</l><l xml:id="m-d1169f4a-542a-4eec-8b57-ab712a710a95" facs="#m-be6c531b-e41c-4b64-96a1-a03c64241792" label="lyrics-like">metuébat Joánnem, sciens eum vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-44559bfd-d94e-474f-8cbb-6a7aafd03362" facs="#m-da87aaef-8980-4996-bffa-40482d332d6c" label="lyrics-like">nis Baptistae. Et contristátus est</l><l xml:id="m-363894a2-13da-486e-a2d9-54bc8d6fc698" facs="#m-33ab186a-52a0-43f8-838e-f7c7525e3f7f" label="lyrics-like">rex: propter jusjurándum, et propter</l><l xml:id="m-056b3f40-1854-4b98-b1dc-d9f15e667ac4" facs="#m-842429ed-a589-42a6-a326-0dd9b42b0d64" label="ambiguous">rum justum et sanctum: et custo¬</l><l xml:id="m-d7c9bb41-de75-45e5-84c2-3680010c2081" facs="#m-8541d677-549e-4e57-b7c3-8e9b56c2c7e4" label="lyrics-like">diébat eum, et audito eo multa</l><l xml:id="m-9cef9a12-004b-4dce-8937-5f59bd8089d8" facs="#m-5e307b1e-a3a9-46cc-a9a0-df4044caecbe" label="lyrics-like">simul discumbéntes, nóluit tam</l><l xml:id="m-9fa99eb8-d580-409e-a0f0-0a2824036876" facs="#m-fd54002a-76c3-4818-a3cc-6197d548abb0" label="lyrics-like">faciébat, et libénter eum audiébat.</l><l xml:id="m-cdd5fa8e-4c5b-44ad-a1e8-67f533903e33" facs="#m-cb48397d-c7fd-400a-b8ed-da9ac0d6d9aa" label="lyrics-like">constristáre : sed misso spiculatóre,</l><l xml:id="m-25475510-f6a8-48c4-aec5-28960ae0124b" facs="#m-f65116ec-1bc1-4067-baed-f65aae935526" label="lyrics-like">Et cum dies opportúnus accidisset,</l><l xml:id="m-2778058c-6fda-4bd3-9cae-d935fe3aa2ab" facs="#m-3668c747-1a30-4834-bda3-910835280ea3" label="lyrics-like">praecépit afférri caput ejus in disco.</l><l xml:id="m-326869c2-e0ba-432e-8fb4-07621ac44185" facs="#m-ce0cf14b-a9e3-4df6-97ef-a334cb5f1d9e" label="lyrics-like">Heródes natális sui coenam fecit</l><l xml:id="m-af4fbebd-94bc-4268-85a0-67898093b2d5" facs="#m-a1d5cf3f-5d79-45c4-8cec-7238ffd34ee9" label="lyrics-like">Et decollávit eum in cárcere. Et</l><l xml:id="m-61bf7ad0-b919-4901-bf03-a97647e83891" facs="#m-808a16bf-9277-4eea-8dff-87eda34c6a70" label="lyrics-like">principibus, et tribúnis, et primis</l><l xml:id="m-45319599-8a13-414c-a216-39ee9d5e2fb4" facs="#m-f5dabfba-0ae3-4c4e-a5aa-9e6fbb31de83" label="lyrics-like">áttulit caput ejus in disco: et dedit</l><l xml:id="m-fc6e7985-a838-486d-83bc-236b664afe25" facs="#m-0a47581a-a976-4358-9c34-c4c7ac9ba6d6" label="lyrics-like">Galilaéae. Cumque introisset filia</l><l xml:id="m-847fcb67-d685-4421-943d-ef160c8b06ae" facs="#m-a80f3df6-9877-4bf8-9cb8-9dfc3de5220d" label="lyrics-like">illud puéllae, et puélla dedit matri</l><l xml:id="m-c9c63543-cf5d-48e9-8581-dd858f539853" facs="#m-d8cab659-1e85-4cc5-8dd9-50e25c80c2a8" label="lyrics-like">ipsius Herodiadis et saltásset, et</l><l xml:id="m-22eb52b5-d3ed-4147-9656-5bd401448125" facs="#m-2add5a08-32ac-4cc1-9117-c4c92cf7ce33" label="ambiguous">suae. Quo audito, discipuli ejus</l><l xml:id="m-38fac65c-cad7-423c-9321-be8a09ad4666" facs="#m-d743274f-9a5b-4c6e-9772-0ebdc87b455a" label="lyrics-like">venérunt, et tulérunt corpus ejus:</l><l xml:id="m-eee9b0ed-5d2e-41df-ac0a-48e21b5222e0" facs="#m-6e2f104b-d8f2-4e66-9852-377698266705" label="lyrics-like">placuísset Heródi simúlque recum¬</l><l xml:id="m-932d65bc-7c7b-4212-a8d3-5da860d2cc6c" facs="#m-a91e4bbd-f8e7-468b-b457-d013929e3d74" label="lyrics-like">béntibus; rex ait puéllae: Pete a</l><l xml:id="m-11189e9d-3628-4f01-85e3-95c4039021ec" facs="#m-4f977e4d-da3a-4b31-8c00-72058f440c2c" label="lyrics-like">et posuérunt illud in monuménto.</l><l xml:id="m-4f1e27ee-7a0d-4344-be02-b4c26a10eaa1" facs="#m-8efcc5da-842c-4aa2-ad50-f3bcac2e322d" label="lyrics-like">offertory. In virtúte túa. p. 1205.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>